cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Agentic virtual screening against the adenosine A2A receptor:
  code and verification data
message: >-
  If you use this repository, cite it by the commit you used rather than by a
  branch. A branch moves; a commit hash does not, and every number in the
  accompanying manuscript is checked against the artifacts at a specific commit.
